  "description": "100-card Jeskai partner deck: TWO commanders via \"Partner with\" (CR 702.124), so it tests the multi-commander path end to end — the CR 903.4 identity UNION (R from Brallin, W/U from Shabraz), the partner-with ETB tutor, and two command-zone objects at once. Also the live vehicle for the two watcher seams the pair is built on: Brallin fires on every DISCARD (counter + damage to each opponent) and Shabraz on every DRAW (counter + life), so the loot/wheel/rummage shell triggers both several times a game.",
